<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5179" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμετά-βᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not changing place,
				stationary,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥλιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cleom.
					2.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					611.5
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>
			<i>without transition,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκινήτως καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>Inst.</u>
					52
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				1162.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>intransitive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῆμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Pron.</u>
					44.12
				</span></i>
			, al. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>
			<i>intransitively,</i> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				158
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>incapable of being traversed,</i> i.e.
				<i>unextended,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.18U.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
